938 0 obj
<<
/Title (diversion. Organized criminal activity requires targeted enforcement, financial investigation and international cooperation. Capital punishment for drug offences should be replaced by proportionate sentencing because it is irreversible, difficult to reconcile with the most serious crimes threshold and vulnerable to discriminatory application. For UNCND, the strongest reframing strategy is a balanced resolution on treatment, harm reduction, proportionality, abolition or moratorium of the death penalty for drug offences, and stronger action against transnational organized crime.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 940 0 R
/Next 936 0 R
>>
endobj
